  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/raw/6eed3e6ca79b5666f7f9ab3ca4e5c61ec3576131/docs/assets/icon/icon_128x128.png\" alt=\"LOD Entity Rendering icon\"></p>\n<h1>LOD 实体渲染</h1>\n<p>一款在 Distant Horizons 的 LOD（细节层次）中渲染实体的 Minecraft 模组。</p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<h3>必需</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdistanthorizons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Distant Horizons</a>\n<ul>\n<li>至少需要 <code>v2.2.1</code> 版本</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>兼容性信息</h2>\n<h3>兼容模组</h3>\n<p>LOD 实体渲染应与大多数（如果不是全部）与 Distant Horizons 兼容的模组兼容。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>\n<ul>\n<li>LOD 实体渲染内置了一个资源包，为 Create 模组添加了实体颜色</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>不兼容项</h3>\n<p>请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/issues?q=is:issue is:open sort:updated-desc label:compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a> 获取不兼容列表。</p>\n<h2>下载</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flodentityrendering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lodentityrendering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/raw/2dc967fc44dc73850eee42c133a55c8ffc5e30cb/assets/compact/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/raw/a7ebbf9844755f6f53218b2a2aebed97b6ff5220/docs/assets/badges/compact/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></p>\n<p>有关支持的 Minecraft 版本，请参阅文件名中的版本信息。<br>\n适用于 Fabric、Quilt、Forge 和 NeoForge 模组加载器。<br>\n支持客户端和服务器端。</p>\n<h2>常见问题</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p>问：你会将此模组移植到较低的 Minecraft 版本吗？<br>\n答：不会。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>问：此模组是否支持多人游戏？<br>\n答：支持。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>问：只有服务器需要此模组，还是客户端也需要？<br>\n答：服务器和客户端都需要此模组。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p>本项目采用 LGPLv3 许可证授权，详情请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/steves-underwater-paradise/lodentityrendering/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a>。</p>",
